<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes slightly down.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes slightly down.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Thursday closed down by 0.13 percent in higher trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 617.43 from 618.25 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 1.254 million dinars against 987,420 dinars.</p>
<p>Banque de Tunisie was down 2.39 dinars to 78.76 dinars. Banque du Sud down 0.9 dinar to 30.13 dinars. ($=0.96 dinar)</p>
